<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">2 Korinthte</book>
  <para style="h">2 Korinthte</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Korinthte</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Korinthte</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Korinthte</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Pathian deihlama Khrist Jesu sawltak leh i unaupa Timothi in; Korinth khua a Pathian saptuam omte kiang leh Akhaia gam tengteng a misiangthou omte kiang ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian i Pa leh Toupa Jesu Khrist kiang a kipan hehpihna leh lemna na kiang uah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I Toupa Jesu Khrist, Pathian leh Pa, hehpihnate Pa leh khamuanna tengteng Pathian phat in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian in koumau hon khamuanna ngei in gimthuakna peuhmah a omte leng ka khamuan sam theihna ding un, aman ka gimthuaknate uah a hon khamuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khrist thuaknate tampitak ka tan bang un, Khrist ziak in khamuanna leng tamsem ka tang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh gimthuak a ka om uleh noumau khamuanna ding leh hotdamna ding ahi a; huan khamuan a ka om uleh ka thuak bang uh na thuak chiang ua na theih ua na khamuanna ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan gimthuakna tangsamte na hih bang un, khamuanna tang samte leng na hi uh chih ka theih un k’on lametsakna uh a kip ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Unaute aw, Asia gam a ka tung ua gimthuakna tung na theihlouh uh ka deihkei uhi, huchi a nakpitak a thuakzoh vuallouh leh hin leng lamet huailou khophial a delhden in ka om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi, sihna thupukna muta in ka kingai uhi; himahleh huai koumau kimuanglou a misite kaithoupa Pathian ka muan zawkna ding uh ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman huchibang sih lauhuai lak ah hon hunkheta a, a hon hunkhe nawn ding; a hon hunkhe nawnzel ding chih amah tung ah ka lametna uh ka nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Noute’n leng thumna in n’on panpih ding uh ahi, huchi in tampite thumna dawnna vualzawlna piak a ka om chiang un koute ziak in mi tampi in kipahthu a gen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koute suanpen hiai ahi, sapilna ah hilou in, Pathian hehpihna hi zaw in siangthouna leh Pathian dikna nei in khovel ah ka gamta ua, nou lam ah ka gamta hoih nawn sem uh chih ka sialehpha theihna un hon theisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na simtheih uleh na theihtheih ding uh loungal thu dang himhim na kiang uah ka gelh kei uhi; a tawppha in ka thu uh na theihsiam uh ka lamen lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Theihsiamna tan na neihtak bang un, i Toupa Jesu ni chiang in, noute k’on suan theih bang un nouleng koute n’on suang thei sam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan huai gintakna nei in, na kiang uah hong masa leng ka chi a, kipahna thuah nih na neih theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Noumau tawn kawm in Masidonia gam ah pai zel leng la, Masidonia gam a kipan a na kiang uah hong kiheinawn in, Judia gam a ka hohna ding ah noumau hong kha le uchin ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchibang ka ngaihtuah lai in ka lungsim kiplouhdan langsak hia ka hih? Ahihkeileh, “Ahi, chih leh, Ahi kei,” chi tuaktuak ding in, thilhih ka tup nak pen khovelmi bang in hia ka tup?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian a muanhuai bang in noumau lam a ka thu uh, Ahi, chih leh Ahi kei, chih ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abang abang hi hen aw, Pathian Tapa Jesu Khrist thu, kei Silvana leh Timothi in na lak ua ka gen un, “Ahi leh Ahi kei” chih ahi sam kei a, Amah ah zaw thil tengteng “Ahi” chih ahi gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian thuchiamte tengteng in amah ah, “Ahi,” chih a muvek hi. Huaiziak in ahi Pathian thupina ding a amah ziak a, “Amen,” ka chih uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan Khrist a noumau toh hon hihkippa leh kou hon sawlpa Pathian ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amah zaw hon chiamtehpa leh i lungtang a khamna Kha hon pepa leng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh ka kha tung a theihpih ding in Pathian ka sam ahi, noumau honhawi ding in ahi Korinth khua a ka hong taklouh zaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na ginna uh hon thuneihkhum hilou in, na kipahna ding ua nou toh semkhawm ka hi zaw uhi; ginna ading kip na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Himahleh keimah lamthu ah zaw hiai ka na tum chiltelta ahi, lungkham nadia na kiang ua hong nawn talou ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ken k’on hih lungkham leh ka hih lungkhampen mahlou in kuan ahia kei honhih kipak ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in huai mahmah ka gelh ahi, huchilou in zaw ka hong in ka kipahna dingte lak ah lungkhamna ka mu zaw kha ding a; ka kipahna zaw na vek ua kipahna a hih k’on gintaksak chiat ngal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khitui tampi kekawm in lungtang a haksa leh lauthawng pipi a ka gelh ahi; hih lungkham a na omna ding uh ahi kei a, na tung ua itna thupi zawsem ka nei chih na theihzawkna ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh kuapeuh in mite a hih lungkham leh keimah kia honhih lungkham ahi kei a, uanggen lua bel hilou in, na vek un a honhih lungkham chiat ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchibang mi adin gawtna na piaktak uh a ki hun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in na ngaidam un na khamuan zawta ding uh ahi, huchilou in zaw bang chichi hiam in mi huchibang a lungkham luatna in a valhzou kha ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaiziak in amah na itna uh hihkip ding in k’on ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiaiziak mah in leng ka gelh ahi, bang peuhmah thu na man uleh, na man louh uh theihchetna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Banglam peuh a mi na ngaihdam uh ken leng ka ngaidam hi; ken ka ngaihdam khitsa, bangpeuh ka na ngaihdam tak leh noumau ziak in Khrist ah ka ngaidam ta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchilou in zaw Setan in nuamtak honsa kha ding hi; a tup lah i haih ngal kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan Khrist Tanchinhoih gen ding a Troas ka tun in, Toupa ah kongkhak honsak in ka om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh ka unaupa Titas ka muhlouh ziak in ka khalam ah zaw muanna himhim ka nei tuankei a, huchi in amaute kampha in ka khen a, ka pawt a, Masidonia gam ah ka paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh Khrist vualzohna a honpi zel pa leh koute a munchih a amah theihna gimnamtui theisakpa Pathian kiang ah kipahthu om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hotdam a omlelte leh mangthang lellelte ah Pathian adin Khrist gimnamtui ka hi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawl khatte adin sihna lak ah sihna ding gimnam ka hi ua, pawl khatte din hinna lak a hinna ding in gimnam ka hi uh. Hiai bangte adin kua ahia chingzou ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi tampi in Pathian thu mite khem a sumsinna a a zat bang un kou zaw ka zang kei uhi; Pathian sawltak hi zaw in, chihtaktak in Pathian mitmuh in Khrist ah thu ka gen zel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Koumau kigenhoih pan nawn dek ka hi uhia? Ahihkeileh, na kiang ua piak ding hiam aw na kiang ua kipan hiam genhoihna lai, mi khenkhat adia a kiphamoh bang in kou din a kiphamoh sam ding ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Noute ka lai uh, na lungtang ua gelh, mi tengteng theih leh sim na hi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khrist lai, kou hon gelhsak laitui a gelh hilou, Pathian hing Kha gelh hi zaw, suangpek a gelh hilou, sa lungtang pek a gelh hi zaw na hi uh chih chiantak in na taklang ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan Pathian lam ah huchibang muanna Khrist vang in ka nei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangpeuh koumau a kipan a pawt a sim ding in koumau kia in ka chin uh ka chi kei ua; ka chin theihna uh Pathian kiang a kipan ahizaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amahmah in thukhun thak nasemte hi ding in hon chingsak a; a lai thu gelhlel nasemte ding hilou in, a Kha nasemte din ahizaw hi; lai thu gelh lel in zaw ahihlum nak a, Kha in bel a hihhing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mosi mel a vak ziak in Israel tate’n a mel a en gige theikei ua, huai thupina a mang hiaihiai a; sihna nasepna suang a laimal gelh bawn, huchi tel a thupi a a tun leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kha nasepna pen bangchi phet a thupi in a tung diam aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siamlouh tansakna nasepna bawn a thupi leh, diktatna nasepna a thupizaw mahmah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hih thupi a omsa in hiai ah zaw thupina himhim a neita ngal kei a, thupina thupizaw in a khuhtak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangta hiaihiai bawn thupi a a tun leh, om gige ding thupi a tuam in omzaw mahmah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, huchibang lametna ka neih ziak un hangsantak apan ngamna ka nei uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosi hih bang in ka hihkei ua, aman zaw thupina mang hiaihiai man tawpna Israel tate’n a et gige louhna ding un a mai maikhuhna in a khuh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A lungsim ubel hihkhauh in a om a; tuni tanpha in Thukhun Lui a sim un khuhna ngeina hawk louh in a om gige ngal a, huai khuhna Khrist ah hihmang in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh tuni tanpha in Mosi Laibu a sim peuh chiang un a lungtang uah khuhna a om gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh a lungtang uh Toupa lam a ngat peuh chiang un khuhna lakmang ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan Toupa huai Kha ahi a, Toupa Kha omna peuh ah noplenna a om zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in eite zaw i vek un mai khuhlou in limlang bang a Toupa thupina tangsawn sak zel in, amah kibatpih ngeingei a om ding in hihlamdan in i om zel uhi; hiai Toupa a kipan i muh ahi; Amah tuh Kha ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huaiziak in hehpihna ka muh bangzel uleh hiai nasepna ka neih ziak un ka lungke kei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil zumhuai kiselte ka pampaih zawta ua, zekhemna thu ka zang kei ua, Pathian thu tuh mi khemna ding in ka zang kei ua, thutak theisak in Pathian mitmuh in michih sialehpha theihna mit ka tungsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh ka Tanchinhoih uh khuh a a om leh, mangthang lelte ah ahi khuh a a om;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khrist Pathian batpih leh a thupidan Tanchinhoih vak in amau a salhvak theihlouhna ding in, huaite ah hiai khovel pathian in a gingtaloute lungsim a sukmial sakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Koumau thu ka genkei ua, Khrist Jesu Toupa thu ka genzaw uhi, koute leng Jesu ziak in sikha ka hih uh leng ka gen zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu Khrist mel ah Pathian thupidan theihna vak honpe ding in, “Mial a kipan vak a vakkhe ding” chipa Pathian in i lungtangte a salvakta ngal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh thilhihtheihna thupina koute a hilou a, Pathian a a hihtheih zawkna ding in huai gou tuh leibel ah ka kem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Alanglang ah nehden in ka om ua, himahleh ningkitel in ka om tuankei uhi; mangbang in ka om ua himahleh ka lungke tuankei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sawi in ka om ua, himahleh taisan in ka omkei uh; khetpuk in ka om ua, himahleh hihmang in ka omkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka sapum uah chiklaipeuh in leng Jesu sihna ka pu zel ua, Jesu hinna leng ka sapum ua a lat theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Koute hingdam a omlaite Jesu ziak a si ding a matsak in ka om gige ua Jesu hinna leng ka sa sithei ua a lattheihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in koute ah sihna in a sem gige a, nou ah bel hinna in a sem gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh “Ka ging a, huaiziak in thu ka gen ahi” chih gelhpa ginna lungsim ngei pu in, kou leng ka ging ua, thu leng ka gen uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa Jesu kaithoupa’n koute leng Jesu ah hon kaithou sam ding a, noumau toh amah omna mun ah hon dingsak ding chih thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangkim noumau hoihna ding ahi ngal a, hehpihna mi tamzaw ziak a hihkhan a om a, Pathian thupina ding a kipahthugenna nakpitak a a khansak theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai thu ziak in ka bah kei uhi; i pawlam mihing zawngkhal hiaihiai mahleh, i sunglam mihing pen niteng a bawlthak zel in a omzaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka gimthuakna neukha uh tu mitphiatkal sung kia a om ding in, thupina thupitak tangtawn a ding in a hon bawlsak hulhul ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thil muhtheihte enlou in, thil muhtheihlouhte ka en zaw uhi; thil muhtheihte zaw sawtlou kal a ding ahi a, thil muhtheihlouhte bel tangtawn a ding ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I omna lei a puanin pen hihsiat in om mahleh van ah inn, khut a lamlouh, tangtawn a om ding, Pathian a kipan inn kip i nei uh chih i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Van a kipan i omna ding silhthuah ut mahmah in hiai puanin ah thum chihtak in i thum gige uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchibang a silh in omleng vuaktang in i omkei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eite hiai puanin a i omsung in gikpua in thum petmah in i thum ngal ua, silhlou a om i ut ziak ahi kei a, silhthuah a om i ut ziak ahizaw, sithei pen hinna valh zoha a om theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan huai mahmah ding a hon sutuahpa khamna Kha hon pepa Pathian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in pumpi a i omlai teng in Toupa kiang ah i omkei chih thei in, muangtakin i om gige uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Muthei a pailou in, ginna in i paizaw zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Muangtakin i om, huan pumpi a omlou a Toupa kiang a om i utzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in om in, om keileng, amah kipahpih lam mi hih i tum chinten ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Michih in sapum a thilhihte a sia a pha in, i hih bangbang a i muhchiat theihna ding in, Khrist thukhenna tutphah ma ah hihlat in i omvek ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa kihtakna dan thei in mihingte ka hanthawn zel uhi, koute hihna Pathian kiang ah latsak a om bang in, na sialehpha theihna uah leng latsak a ka om uh ka lamen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kiang uah ka kigenhoih nawn uh ahi kei a, lungtang hilou a, dinmun lel suangte bang ahi hiam dawnna ding na neih theihna ding un kou lam ah suan theihna honbawl in ka genzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka hai uleh Pathian adin ahi a; ka pil uleh noumau adin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khrist itna in a honsawl teitei ahi; hichi’n ka ngaihtuah uhi: mi tengteng sihsik in mi khat a si a, huaiziak in mi tengteng a si uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi tengteng sih sik a Khrist a sihna pen a hingte leng amau adia a hin nawnlouh ua, a sihsik ua si a thounawn ading a a hin zawkna ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi a hih ziak in tuban kou zaw salam ah kuamah ka thei nawnta kei ding uh; salam ah Khrist na theita mahle ung leng; tun zaw ka theita kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi a hih ziak in, kuapeuh Khrist a a om leh thilsiam thak a honghi a; thilluite a mangta a, ngai un, a hong thakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Himahleh bangkim Pathian kiang a kipan a pawt ahi a; aman Khrist ziak in amah toh kituak in honbawl a kituahna nasepna a honpia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian in Khrist ah khovel amah toh kituaknawn in a bawl a, a tatleknate uh tatlekna a sehsak lou in, kituahnawnna thu hon kemsak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Khrist palai ka hi ua, Pathian in koute zang in a hon ngen ahi; Pathian toh kituakta un aw chi in, Khrist sik in k’on ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah a Pathian diktatna i hong hih theihna ding in khelhna himhim theilou amah Pathian in eite ziak in khelhna in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian hehpihna phattuampih lou a na tan louhna ding un, amah seppih koute’n k’on ngen petmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hun kipahhuai ah k’on ngaikhia a, hotdamna ni ah k’on panpih” a chi ngal a. Ngai un, tu hun kipahuai ahi a; ngai un, tu hotdamna ni ahi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka nasepna uh dem a omlouhna ding in banglam peuh ah kuamah pukloh ding himhim ka bawl kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian nasemte bang in bangkim ah mi mit tung in ka om zawzel ua, nakpi a kuhkalna ah, haksatna ah, taksapna ah, lunggimna ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vuakna ah, hentakna ah, buaina ah, sepgimna ah, ihmutmohna leh gilkialna ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siangthouna, theihna, dohtheihna, chitna, Kha Siangthou leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Itna taktak, thutakna leh Pathian thilhihtheihna nei in; taklam leh veilam a diktatna galvante zang in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thupina leh pahtawi louhna, min gensiat leh min genhoihna ah leng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Midiktat hi ngal in mikhemte bang a bawl in ka om ua; min thangtak hi ngal in theih thamlouh bang in, si dekdek a vuak a om in, hihlup louh in ngai dih ua, ka hing uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungkham tak a om in, himahleh kipak gige ngal in; zawngtak hi ngal a, bangkim a midangte hih hausa in ka om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Korinthte aw, na kiang uah ka kamka ua, ka lungtang uh hihlet in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koumau henchip in na omkei ua, noumau na thil deihlam uah na kihenchip zaw uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in k’on piak bangbang honpe thuk sam ding in tate kiang a gen bang in ka gen ahi, nou leng na lungtangte uh zasak sam un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ginglou mite toh kituak loupi a hakkol paw khawm in omkei un; diktatlouhna leh diktatna in bang ahia kikopna a neih uh? Ahihkeileh, mial leh vak in bang ahia kithuahna a neih uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Belial leh Khrist in leng bang ahia kituahna a neih uh? Ahihkeileh, ginglou leh gingmi’n bang ahia tankhawm a neih uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Milimte leh Pathian tempul in leng bang ahia kituahna a neih uh? Eite zaw Pathian hing tempul i hi ngal ua; “Pathian in, amau ah ka om dia, amau ah leng ka pawt dia; huan a Pathian uh ka hidia, amau leng ka mite ahi ding uh, a chih bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaiziak in, a lak ua kipan in hongpawt unla, a tuam in om un, thil sianglou himhim khoih kei un, Toupa’n a chi, huchi in, k’on kipahpih dia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nou din na Pa uh ka hidia, nou leng kei din tanu tapa na hi ding uh, Toupa bangkim hihthei in a chi” chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in, deihtakte aw, huai thuchiam i neih ziak un, sa leh kha buahna tengteng ah i kisiangsak ding uh, Pathian laudansiam kawm a siangthouna hih kim in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na lungtang uah mun hon awn un; kua tung mah ah ka khial kei uh, kuamah ka hihgawp kei uh, kuamah tung ah hamphat ka tum kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai siamlouh nou hong tangsak ding in ka chi kei; sih leh sih chiat a, dam leh dam chiat ding in ka lungtang uah nou k’on vom uh chih tuma zek in ka genta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nou lam ah zaw ka pau ngamdan a thupi a k’on suan dan a thupi hi: khamuanna in ka dim a, ka haksatna tengteng uah nuamsa in ka dimlet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Masidonia gam ka tun un leng ka sa un muanna himhim a nei tuankei a, khatlam khatlam a hihgim in ka om zawta ua; pawlam kisualnate a om a; sunglam launate leng a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh, nuaisiah a omte khamuanpa, Pathian in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Titas hongna in hon khamuanta a; a hongna kia in ahi kei a, na lungkham dante uh, na kahdante uh, ka tung a na phattuamngaihdante uh honhilh in, noumau a a khamuanna mah in leng a hon khamuanta ahi; huchi in, ka kipak nawn sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka laikhak in honhih lungkham mah leng, ka kisik kei hi; a tung in ahihleh ka kisik a, huai laikhak in nou a honhih lungkham chih ka theih ziak in; himahleh sawtloukal kia ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tun zaw ka kipak ahi, hih lungkham a na om ziak uh ahi kei a, kisikna ding a na lungkham ziak un ahizaw hi. Koumau ziak a bangmah na tan louhna ding un Pathian deihlam bang a hih lungkham in na om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian deihlama lungkhamna in hotdamna ding in, kisikna a bawl a, kisikhuai thil a tun kei; khovel lungkhamna in bel sihna a tunzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Enmah un, Pathian deihlama lungkhamna in bangchibang chihtakna, bangchibang kihahsiang nopna, bangchibang kiawilouhna, bangchibang patauhna, bangchibang lunggulhna, bangchibang phattuamngaihna, bangchibang gawtna ahia nou adia hontut tak. Bangkim ah huai thu ah na siang uh chih na kihihlang ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in, na kiang uah gelh mahleng, a gilou hihpa ziak in ka gelh kei a, a gilou thuakpa ziak in leng ka gelh sam kei, ka tung ua na phattuam ngaihdan uh Pathian mitmuh a na kiang ua theihsaka a om theihna ding in ka gelh ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in, khamuan in ka omta him ua; koumau khamuanna kia lou ah leng, Titas kipahna ziak in ka kipak nawnsem ua, nou tengteng in a lungsim na hihhalhsak tak ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kiang ah banglam peuh ah leng noumau honsuang mahle ung, ka zahlak ngal kei ua, zahlak nak sang in bangkim, na kiang ua thu taktaka ka genzel bang un, Titas ma a k’on suan uh thu taktak a honghita ngei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan, na vek ua a thu na mandante uh, lau leh ling kawm a amah na kipahpih dante uh theigige in, a lungsim noumau lam ah a nakte’n nawnsem ta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thil bangkim ah na tung ua ka muan ziak in ka kipak ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, unaute aw, Masidonia gam a saptuam pawlte lak a Pathian hehpihna piak pen k’on theisak ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi a haksa thuakna ze-etna thupi a a kipahna uh dimlet leh nakpi a a gentheihna uh dimlet a thilphalna thupi uh a hong hih dan bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A neih bang un, ahi, a neih sang ua thupi in leng, amau ut thu un a pia uh chih theih pih ka hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiai hehpihna leh misiangthoute nasepsakna thu a nakpitak a hon ngen ngutngut in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai leng ka lamet louh bang un a hih ua, Pathian deihlam in, amau mahmah Toupa kiang ah leh kou kiang ah a kipe masa phot ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in, tuma a a patsa, hiai hehpihna leng noumau a hihkim nalai ding in Titas ka ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in, bangkim ginna, thugen siamna, theihna, phattuamngaihna tengteng, n’on itna uh na hauh bang un, huai hehpihna leng na hauh theihna ding un thanop suah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thupia bang in ka gen kei a, midang phattuamngaihna in na itna uh gildan leng chian ding in ka gen ahizaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I Toupa Jesu Khrist hehpihna, a gentheihna ziak a na hong hauh theihna ding un hau mahleh noumau ziak ngeingei a hong gentheih takdan, na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in, huai ah ka ngaihdan bang ahia ka gen hi: kum khat paita a na hihpat kia uleng hilou a na ut pat uh tuin buchingsakta le uchin nou adin a hoihpen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in, ut ding a kimanna a om bang in, na neih bangzel ua tangtunna leng a omtheihna ding in, tun ah zaw hih tangtungta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kimanna pen a om phot leh, mi a neihlouhpi hilou in, a neih bangzel a a piak kipahpih tuak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Midang a gim louh ua, nou na gimna ding un ka chi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kibatlualna ding in, na hauhna uh tulai in a taksap awnghukna a hong hih a, a hauhna uleng na taksap awnghukna uh a honghih sam theihna ding in ka chi ahizaw, huchi in, kibatlualna a hongom thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“A khawm tam in a val in a neikei a, a khawm tawm in leng a tasam tuankei” chih gelh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan, ken nou k’on awlmoh bang a awlmohna lungtang Titas kiang a pepa Pathian kiang ah kipahthu om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka ngetna uh a hon sansak a; himahleh ka nget ziak kia uh hilou in, amah phatuamngaihna in, amah ut thu in na kiang ua hoh dia pawt ding in a kisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Unaupa khat toh amah k’on sawl uhi. Tua unaupa a saptuam un tanchinhoih lam a a phatna uh saptuam pawl tengteng ah a thangsuak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi lel leng ahi kei a, Hiai hehpihna thawnpiak paw ding a kou toh zin vialvial ding saptuam telkhiak ahi a, Toupa thupina ding in hiai thil thawnpiak ka hawm ua, midangte huh na ki thalawpna uh ensak ding in leng ka hawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hiai thilpiak ka hawmna lam uah kuamah in a hondem louhna ding un ka pilvang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa ngaihdan kia in hilou in, mihing ngaihdan a leng thil kilawm ka ngaihtuah khol zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan, a kiang uah ka unaupa uh ka sawl ding ua, amah thil tampitak ah phatuamngai tak ahi chih tamveipi ka theichianta uhi, tu khol a houh nou a hon taksan mahmah ziak in phatuam a ngai nawn sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Titas ahihleh, ka lawm leh noumau lam a ka naseppih ahi a; huan, ka unaute uh ahihleh, saptuam pawlte palai, Khrist thupina ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huaiziak in, na it uh chih theihna leh, k’on suanna uh theihtelna saptuam pawlte ma ah a kiang uah langsak un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Misiangthoute adia thilpiak thu zaw na kiang uah ka gelh a kiphamoh kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na kiman dan uh ka thei ngal a, huailam thu ah zaw kum khat ahita Akhaia gamte kimansa in a omta uh chi in Masidonia gam a mite kiang ah k’on na suang zel a; na phattuamngaihna un a lak ua mi tampi a tawk halhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh huailam thu ah zaw k’on suanna bangmahlou a hong hih louhna ding in unaute ka hohsak zel a, ka gen bangtak a mansa a nana om theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchilou in zaw Masidonia gam a mi kuate hiam in a honzuih zenzen uleh, kimanlou in hong mu le uh, noute kia hilou in noute k’on ginna uh lam ah kou leng ka zahlak kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaiziak in unaute bel nou kiang a hong masa a, hoihtak a thilpiak na chiamkholhte uh na bawlkhol ding a, nget kiphamoh in ka gingta hi, laksak teitei bang hilou a phaltak a piak bang zaw in mansa a na omna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh huailam thu ah zaw, theh tawm in a at tawm ding a, theh tam in a at tam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Michih in it pipi a pelou in, piaklouh theihlouh a ngaihtuah a pe tuanlou in, a lungtang ua a tup bangzel un pe chiat uhen; Pathian in kipaktak a pemite a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan Pathian in hehpihna chiteng in na tung uah a vukthei ahi; huchi in nou bangkim ah a hun ngial nei gige in, nasep hoih chiteng a ding in na hau thei ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“A hawmzak a; gentheite kiang ah a pia a; a diktatna tangtawn in a om gige” chih gelh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thehpa kiang a a chi pepa leh nek ding a tanghou pepa’n na theh ding uh chi a honpe dia a hon hih pungsak ding a, na diktatna gahte uh leng a hon hih pungsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thilphalna chiteng kou ziak a Pathian kiang a kipahthu genna pen nei ding a, bangkim a hihhauh a om in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiai sepsakna nna in misiangthoute taksapna awngte a huksak kia ahi kei a, Pathian kiang a kipahthu genna tampi in, a luang let nalai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hiai nasepna a etkhiak a om in Khrist Tanchinhoih lam a na thugin uh na zuihdan uleh amau ading leh mi tengteng adia thilpiak a na thilphal dan un Pathian na hihthupi ding uh ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amau ngei in leng na tung ua Pathian hehpihna thupi mahmah ziak in, nou adia thumsak kawm in a hon ngai mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thilpiak genzawh vuallouh ziak in Pathian kiang ah kipahthu om hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan kei Paul, na lak ua na mitmuh ua thunuailuttak a om a, na kiang ua omlouh tak a noumau lam a khauh in Khrist lungnemna leh nunnemna in k’on ngen ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi, na kiang ua ka om chiang in khenkhat sa bang a om a honsepte tung a hangsantak a om ka tup ngamna bang in, k’on khauhkhum a kul louhna ding in k’on ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sa ah om mah leng sa kidou bang in i dou kei ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eite kigalvannate zaw sa leng ahi kei a, kulhpi kiptak phelna ding a Pathian ziak a thilhihtheitak galvan ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lung a gel pansante leh thilsang chiteng Pathian theihna dal ding a sangtak a bawlte i phuk zel; ngaihtuahna chiteng Khrist thumanna sikha a pi in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na thumandan uh hihkim a a om chiang in, thumanlouhna tengteng phula ding nangawn a leng mansa in ka om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Noute’n pawlam muhtheih thilte kia en na hi u maw? Kuapeuh in Khrist ahi a a kigintak leh amah kingaihtuah nawn hen, amah Khrist a ahi bang in, koute leng ka hi sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thuneihna uh nou hihsiatna ding ahi kei a, noumau bawlhoih zawkna ding a Toupa’n a honpiak suang mah leng ka zahlak kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka laikhakte a nou hon hihlau tum bang a ka latlouhna ding in huai ka chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“A laikhakte zaw a gik in a khauh a, a sa a hongom leh mi zawngkhalpi ahi a, a pau leng a deihthoh huai,” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka omlouh chiang ua ka laikhakte ua ka thugelh uleh, huailai a na kiang ua ka om chiang ua ka hih ding uh a kibatlouhna a omkei chih huchibang mite’n a theisiam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khenkhat amau kiphatte lak ah ka kisim khawm ngam kei ua, amau toh leng ka kitehpih ngam sam kei uhi. Himahleh amau zaw amau leh amau kiteh in amau leh amau kitehpih in lungsim neilou in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kou zaw Pathian hontehna val in ka kiuangsak kei ding uhi, mohpuakna a honpiak bangzel in ka kiuangsak zaw ding uhi, noumau ngei leng huai mohpuakna in hon huamkhak na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka thuneih phaklouhna ding tantan uh hong uk hilou in, Khrist Tanchinhoih gen in na khua ua tam in ka hongpai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Koute ka hihna pel ua kiphat hiam, midang sepgimnate kisuanpih ka hi kei uhi; na ginna uh a khandan bangzel in, na lak ua ka nasepna uh nakpitak a hihlet in om leh chih lametna ka nei zaw uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />huchi in midang nasepsa suang hilou a, nou khenlam gamte pha in Tanchinhoih ka gen theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh “A suang peuh in Toupa suang hen.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amah kiphat in phat a loh ngal kei a, Toupa’n a genhoih in phat a loh zaw ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hai deuhna uah noute’n Pathian ah n’on thuaktheih uh ka ut hi: Ahi, thuak leng n’on thuak thei ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian hawmthohna, thikthuse khop in ahi nou k’on deihthoh; Khrist kiang a nungak siangthou bang a ka honpiak theihna ding in, pasal khat k’on hawisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh gul in a zuau pil a Evi a khem bang in, Khrist lam a takna leh siangthouna a kipan bangchi hiam in na lungsim uh a hihse kha ding, chih ka lauthawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khattei hongpai a Jesu dang, a thu ka gen ngeilouh uh, a gen a, kha lamdang na muh ngeilouh uh, leh Tanchinhoih lamdang na san ngeilouh uh, na pompah un kipe baih lua na himah kei ding ua hia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hiai Sawltaklian thuneipen na chihte uh sang in banglam peuh ah niamzawkna nei in ka kigingta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thugen lam ah pau zatsiam kei mah leng theihna ah zaw huchibang ka hi kei uhi; huai noute kiang ah banglam peuh leh thil tengteng ah ka kilang sak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihkeileh, Pathian Tanchinhoih a thawn lel a k’on hilh ziak a tawisan a na om theihna ding ua ka kihihniam in thil ka hihkhial ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na nna uh ka sep theihna ding in midangte a kipan a huhna la in, saptuam pawl dangte ka lok ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan na kiang ua ka om a, ka taksap lai in, kuamah k’on hihbuai kei a; unau Masidonia gam a kipan a hongpaite’n ka taksap awng a hong huksak ngal ua: bangkim ah noumau hihbuailou in ka kibawl bang in, ka kibawl zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khrist thutak keimaha a om bang in, hiai ka kisuanna zaw Akhaia gam lam a hihdaih in a omkei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangziak in? K’on it louh ziak hia? Pathian in k’on it a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan a nasep uh kisaktheihpih a, kou sep bangbang a sem kichite kichihna ka bulkalh theihna ding in ka sep tuh ka sem zom zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi huchibangte zaw Khrist sawltak a kibawltawm a, sawltak takloute, nasemmi, mi khemhatte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huai ahihleh a lamdang kei; Setan hial leng vak sawltak in a kibawl tawm nak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huaiziak in a nasemte leng diktatna nasemmi in kibawltawm mahle uh thillamdang ahi kei; huaite tawpna zaw a thilhih bangzel un ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka chi nawn: kuamah in mihai in honsep kei uhen: himahleh n’on seh vanglak uleh, ken leng neu chik bek a ka kisaktheih sam theihna ding in mihai bangtak in honpom un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka genzaw Toupa thuneihna in ka gen kei a, ka kisaktheihna mihai bangtak in ka genzaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi tampite’n khovel thilte a kisaktheihpih ziak un keileng k’ong kisathei sam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nou bel mi pil na hih ziak un mihaite lungkimtakin na thuakzou zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi sal a hon bawlte, hon negaite, nuamtak honsa a na tung ua kiliansak leh na mai ua hon bengte na thuakthei zel ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi dia zaw hatlou lua mah kei ve ua! Kisit in ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hebrute ahi uhia? Keileng ka hi. Israelte ahi uhia? Keileng ka hi. Abraham suante ahi uhia? Keileng ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khrist nasemte ahi uhia? Mihai bang in genta leng, ka hi sem; sepgimna ah thupi sem in, suangkulh tanna ah bang thupi sem in, vuakna ah bang a kan a val in, sih lauhuaina tamveipi ka tuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judate lak ah vuakna khatvei a sawmli chinglou ngavei ka tuak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thumvei chiang a khet in ka om a, khatvei suang a den in ka om hi, thumvei longsiatna ka tuak, zan khat leh ni khat tuipi ah taihmang in ka om hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khualzinna ah tamveipi, luite lak ah lauhuai, suammite lak ah lauhuai, ka chipihte lak ah lauhuai, Jentelte lak ah lauhuai, khopi ah lauhuai, gamdai ah lauhuai, tuipi ah lauhuai, unau takloute lak ah lauhuai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Septawlna leh sepgimna, ihmutmohna ah tamveipi, gilkial leh dangtakna ah, anngawlna ah tamveipi, khosik leh vuaktang a omnate.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan hiaite ban a kigenlou saptuam pawl tengteng ka ngaihtuahna niteng a hon delh gige leng a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi hatlou ka awlmohpih louh kua a om a? A puksia ka lungkhampih louh kua a om ngei a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Suang ding ka hih vanglak leh ka hatlouhna lam thilte ahi ka suan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Toupa Jesu Pathian leh Pa, tangtawn a hampha in, zuau ka gen louh dan a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Damaska khua ah kumpipa Areta nuai a gamukpa’n hon man ding in Damaskate khopi a veng sak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huan kulhbang tohlet ah bawm in hon khaikhia ua, huchi in a khut a kipan ka suakta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka kiuangsak lai ding hi. Ka phattuampih ding a omkei na a, himahleh Toupa kiang a kipan kilakna leh theihsakna thu ka genzom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khrist a mi khat ka thei; huai mi tuh kum sawmlehli ahita a, pumpi in hia a om ka theikei, pumpi lou in hia a om ka thei sam kei: Pathian in a thei, van thumna hial ah laktouh in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai mi mahmah, sapum in hia a om, sapum lou in hia ka theikei; Pathian in a thei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Paradise a laktouh a a omdan, thugen vuallouh, mihing gensiang loute a za chih ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi huchibang ahihleh ka suang ding; himahleh ka hatlouhna louzaw keimah ka kisuang kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Suan ut mah leng mihai ka hi kei ding, thu taktak ka gendek ngal a; himahleh ka kidek ding, huchilou in zaw kuapeuh in honmuh bang uleh ka lak a thu a zak sang un hon ngai thupizaw kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan theihsakna a thupi mahmah ziak a ka kingaihlet luat louhna ding in ka sa ah ling honpia ahi, Setan sawltak, khutthak nuhna dia hon zang ding ngei; huchilou in zaw ka kingailian kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai thil tungtang thu ah hon awngsut theihna ding in Toupa thumvei ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan aman ka kiang ah, “Ka hehpihna nang di’n a hun hi, ka thilhihtheihna hatlouhna ah ahi hihkim a a om” a chi hi. Huchi in Khrist thilhihtheihna ka tung a a omtheihna ding in kipaktak in ka hatlouhnate ka suang zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in Khrist ziak a hatlouhna ah, liamna ah, taksapna ah, sawina ah, lungngaihna ah ka kipak zel hi; ka hatlouh peuhpeuh chiang in ahi ka hat zawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hai ka na hita: nou hailou theilou in n’on bawl ua ahi: kei pen noumau hon pahtawi ding keive, bangmah hi kei mah leng, banglam peuh ah leng sawltaklian thuneipente ka phalou kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka sawltaklian hih chiamtehnate kuhkalna chiteng toh chiamtehnate, thillamdangte, thilhihtheihnate in na lak ua hih ahi taktak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bang lam ah ahia, saptuam pawl dangte sang a niam zaw a bawl a na omna uh? Keimah ngeingei in k’on hihbuai louhna lam thu ah a hih kei ngal leh. Huai diklouhna ah hon ngaidam un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai un, hiai na kiang ua hong ding a ka sawm a thumveina ahi; noute k’on hihbuai kei ding, na thilneihte uh hilou in noumau hondeih ka hi zaw hi; tate’n nu leh pate ding in a kholkhawm sak ding uh ahi kei a, nu leh pate’n tate ding in a kholkhawm sak zaw ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan ken zaw na kha ua ding a kipaktak in ka kizangbei ding a, ka kizangbei vek lai ding hi. A kan a val a nou k’on it ziak in ken noute itna tawm zaw muhna in ka nei ahi maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh kei mahmah in k’on hihbuai louhna ah kei lepchiah pil leh zekhemna a noute hon man na sa ua hiam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na kiang ua ka misawl kuahiamte zang in nou k’on hamphat pih ngei ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Noute kiang a hongpai ding in Titas ka ngen a, amah toh unaupa k’on sawl hi. Titas in nou a hon hamphatpih himhim hia? Kha kibang a gamta khawm ka hi kei ua hia? Khap kibang a pai ka hi kei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Noumau kiang a kou leh kou kiphalam n’on sa ua hia? Khrist ah Pathian mitmuh in ahi thu ka gen uh. Himahleh deihtakte aw, bangkim noumau bawl hoihna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka hongpai chiang in bangchi hiam a ka lamet bang a k’on muh kei leh kei deih bang in n’on mu kei kha ding uh chih leh, bangchi hiam in kitainate, kihazatnate, hehnate, kilangkhennate, kigennate, kihuaukhumnate, kingaihlet luatnate, buainate a om in k’on mukha ding chih ka lau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na kiang ua ka hong chiang in ka Pathian in na lak uah honhih zahlak nawn in thil hihkhialte leh thilsianglou hihte, kingaite, huk ching a kisik tuanlou in mi tampite ka kahkhum kha ding chih ka lau hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiai pen na kiang a ka hong a a thumveina ding ahi. “Theihpih nih hiam, thum hiam kam ah thu chiteng hihkip in a om ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka genkholta a, a nihveina a na kiang ua ka omlai a ka gen bang in, tun ah na kiang ua omlou in, tuma lam a thil hihkhialte kiang ah leh midang tengteng kiang ah ka genkhol nawn dek hi, ka hong nawn leh ka hawi kei ding, chih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khrist keimah a thugen zelpa pen ze-etna na zon ziak un, amah zaw noumau lam ah a hatlou kei a, na lak uah thilhihtheitak ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah hatlouhna ziak a kilhlup himahleh Pathian thilhihtheihna ziak in a hing gige hi. Kou leng amah ah ka hat kei uhi, himahleh, noumau lam a Pathian thilhihtheihna ziak in a kiang ah ka hingsam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ginna ah na omna uhiam chih noumau ngeingei ki enchian zel un. Ahihkeileh noumau ah Jesu Khrist a om chih noumau ngeingei in na thei chian kei ua hia? Deihlouh na hih kei ngal uleh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kou deihlouh in ka omkei uh chih na thei lai ding un ka gingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan thil himhim na hihkhelh louhna ding un Pathian kiang ah ka ngen zel uh; koute deihhuai a ka lat theihna ding uh ahi kei a, koute deihlouh in om mahle ung noute’n a kilawm peuhmah na hih theihna ding uh ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thutak gum ding lou in zaw, thutak dou ding in bangmah ka hih theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Koute ka hatlouh lai un leng noute na hat un ka kipak uhi; noumau hoihlam a na kibawlphat uh thumna a ka nget uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in hihse ding hilou a bawlhoih ding zaw a, Toupa’n thuneihna honpiak bangzel in, na kiang ua ka om chiang a nakpitak a k’on taihilh louhna ding in, na kiang ua ka omlouh lai in hiai thu ka gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tawppen in, unaute aw, kipaktak in om un, na omdan uh bawlhoih unla; k’on ngetna limsak unla, khamuangtak in om unla; lungsim munkhat pu unla, kituaktakin om unla; huchi in itna leh lemna Pathian na kiang ua om ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tawp siangthou in chibai kibuk un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi Siangthou tengteng in chibai a honbuk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa Jesu Khrist hehpihna, Pathian itna, Kha Siangthou kithuahpihna na vek ua kiang ah om hen, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
